---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Documentation — How to Use the Data Converter" description="Learn how to convert between JSON, CSV, Excel, XML, YAML, Markdown, HTML, and PDF. Complete guide with shortcuts, tools, and privacy info." keywords="documentation, how to convert, format conversion, data converter" breadcrumbs={[{name:'Home',url:'/'},{name:'Docs',url:'/docs'}]} schema={{
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'TechArticle',
  name: 'How to Use the Data Converter',
  description: 'Complete guide to converting between JSON, CSV, Excel, XML, YAML, Markdown, HTML, and PDF.',
  applicationCategory: 'UtilityApplication',
  author: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Naim Biswas' },
}}>
  <main class="docs">
    <h1>How to Use the Data Converter</h1>

    <section>
      <h2>Supported Formats</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><h3>JSON</h3><p>JavaScript Object Notation — nested or flat objects, arrays of objects.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>CSV</h3><p>Comma-separated values — header row required.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Excel (XLSX)</h3><p>Microsoft Excel workbooks with multi-sheet support. Upload only.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>XML</h3><p>Extensible Markup Language — flattens nested elements with <code>_</code> separator.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>YAML</h3><p>YAML Ain't Markup Language — human-readable data serialization.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>HTML Table</h3><p>Output only — renders data as an HTML <code>&lt;table&gt;</code>.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Markdown</h3><p>Output only — renders data as a GitHub-flavored Markdown table.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>PDF</h3><p>Output only — exports data as a PDF document.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Input Methods</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Paste</strong> — paste data directly into the editor.</li>
        <li><strong>Upload</strong> — drag & drop or browse for a file (.json, .csv, .xml, .yaml, .xlsx up to 50 MB).</li>
        <li><strong>URL</strong> — fetch data from a remote URL. Enable the CORS proxy for APIs that block direct requests.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How to Convert</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Select the source format (<strong>From</strong>) and target format (<strong>To</strong>) in the converter bar.</li>
        <li>Paste, upload, or fetch your data.</li>
        <li>Click <strong>Convert</strong> or press <kbd>Ctrl+Enter</kbd>.</li>
        <li>Preview, search, sort, and edit the table.</li>
        <li>Download the result in any supported format, or copy to clipboard.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Table Tools</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Search</strong> — filter rows by any column value.</li>
        <li><strong>Sort</strong> — click a column header to sort ascending/descending.</li>
        <li><strong>Inline Edit</strong> — double-click any cell to edit its value.</li>
        <li><strong>Find &amp; Replace</strong> — search and replace text across all cells.</li>
        <li><strong>Transpose</strong> — swap rows and columns.</li>
        <li><strong>Case Transforms</strong> — UPPER, lower, or Capitalize an entire column.</li>
        <li><strong>Add / Delete</strong> rows and columns.</li>
        <li><strong>Undo / Redo</strong> — <kbd>Ctrl+Z</kbd> and <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+Z</kbd>.</li>
        <li><strong>Column Reorder</strong> — drag column headers to reorder.</li>
        <li><strong>Remove Empty / Duplicates</strong> — clean up your data.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Export</h2>
      <p>Download buttons apply to the <em>filtered</em> data (search and sort are respected). Clipboard copies the full dataset.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Tools Menu</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Generate Random Data</strong> — creates a random CSV dataset for testing.</li>
        <li><strong>Base64 Encode / Decode</strong> — encode or decode the editor content.</li>
        <li><strong>Hex Encode / Decode</strong> — encode or decode the editor content.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Privacy</h2>
      <p>All processing happens entirely in your browser. No data is sent to any server. The URL fetch with CORS proxy enabled routes through a third-party proxy service.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Keyboard Shortcuts</h2>
      <table class="shortcuts">
        <thead><tr><th>Shortcut</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><kbd>Ctrl+Enter</kbd></td><td>Convert</td></tr>
          <tr><td><kbd>Ctrl+Z</kbd></td><td>Undo</td></tr>
          <tr><td><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+Z</kbd></td><td>Redo</td></tr>
          <tr><td><kbd>Escape</kbd></td><td>Close find/replace or case toolbar</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .docs {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }
  .docs h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .docs h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 550;
    margin: 32px 0 16px;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .docs p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .docs ul, .docs ol {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .docs li {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .docs code {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    background: var(--code-bg);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .docs kbd {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .card {
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .card h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 550;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .shortcuts {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .shortcuts th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .shortcuts td {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .docs { margin: 24px auto; }
    .docs h1 { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
